      "problem": "Terminal CFG row is accepted as a generic relative path instead of the pinned Campaign.SAVE_PATH user://campaign.cfg. On Windows root-only /other.cfg also passes is_absolute/drive checks and joins outside user root. A matching unrelated file may be treated as the durable campaign CFG.",
